Robert Webster Bates was Shannon's grandfather. He and Esta Delia Helms married in Harmon County, Oklahoma, on 5 October 1922 and went on to have twelve children together, raising their family across Oklahoma, New Mexico, and Colorado before settling in Arizona. Robert had one additional child outside this marriage — see Children, below.  
